  "taal_vir_mens": [
    "[taal, protected word] 'voorwerpbronne': Asked for explicitly: 'voorwerpbron/voorwerpbronne' is a regular Afrikaans noun-noun compound (like 'inligtingsbron'), transparent in meaning and readable for a nine-year-old, and it sits naturally beside 'visuele, mondelinge en geskrewe bronne'. I see no language reason to change it; no better form is proposed.",
    "[taal, protected word] 'Soms wys hulle nie genoeg nie en die vraag bly oop.': By the AWS 2017 rule in the brief, this 'en' joins two sentences with their own subject and verb ('hulle wys' and 'die vraag bly'), so it needs a comma: 'Soms wys hulle nie genoeg nie, en die vraag bly oop.' Not changed because the wording is protected; a person should decide whether the protection covers the punctuation."
  ],
